IFS No.22
  Parallel Model Generation Theorem Prover: MGTP


  MGTP(Model Generation Theorem Prover) is the parallel theorem prover 
based on KL1.
  This program is written by parallel program language KL1, and
executable on PSI-II,PSI-III,multi-PSI.
  The files required are : 

   otter.kl1
   rotter.kl1
   preotter.kl1
   prerotter.kl1

  For install this system, you need to compile all files with suffix
'kl1' to KL1 code.
  And the manual is 'manualE.tex'.





